`tolerationSeconds` only applies to `NoExecute` taints, so I think this section could be simplified to:

```
for _, toleration := range tolerations {
  if toleration.TolerationSeconds == nil {
    filteredTolerations = append(filteredTolerations, toleration)
  }
}
```

As this will capture all `NoSchedule` tolerations and all `NoExecute` taints without a tolerationSeconds set
